{"strongs": "H0032", "word": "אֲבִיחַ֫יִל", "translit": "a.vi.ha.yil", "root": "אבה", "morph": "N:N-M-P", "pos": "proper name, masculine", "gloss": "my father is might", "definition": "אֲבִיחַ֫יִל proper name, masculine & feminine ( my father is might , Sabean אבחיל Hal MA 234 ) — probably = אֲבִיהַיִל 2Chr 11:18 , אֲבִיהָ֑יִל 1Chr 2:29 — 1. a Levite Num 3:25 . 2. a Gadite 1Chr 5:14 . 3. father of Esther Esth 2:15 ; Esth 9:29 . 4. wife of Abishur 1Chr 2:29 . 5. wife of Rehoboam 2Chr 11:18 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB27')\">BDB27</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H32')\">H32</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB26')\">BDB26</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB28')\">BDB28</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>אֲבִיחַ֫יִל</bdbheb> <b>proper name, masculine</b> &amp; <b>feminine</b> (<highlight>my father is might</highlight>, Sabean <bdbheb>אבחיל</bdbheb> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Hal')\">Hal<sup>MA 234</sup></lookup>) — probably = <bdbheb>אֲבִיהַיִל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Chr 11:18\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(14,11,18)\">2Chr 11:18</ref>, <bdbheb>אֲבִיהָ֑יִל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Chr 2:29\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(13,2,29)\">1Chr 2:29</ref> — <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> a Levite <ref ref=\"Num 3:25\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(4,3,25)\">Num 3:25</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> a Gadite <ref ref=\"1Chr 5:14\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(13,5,14)\">1Chr 5:14</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> father of Esther <ref ref=\"Esth 2:15\" b=\"17\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(17,2,15)\">Esth 2:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"Esth 9:29\" b=\"17\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(17,9,29)\">Esth 9:29</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>4.</b> wife of Abishur <ref ref=\"1Chr 2:29\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(13,2,29)\">1Chr 2:29</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>5.</b> wife of Rehoboam <ref ref=\"2Chr 11:18\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(14,11,18)\">2Chr 11:18</ref>. </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "2Chr 11:18", "book": "2CH", "chapter": 11, "verse": 18}, {"raw": "1Chr 2:29", "book": "1CH", "chapter": 2, "verse": 29}, {"raw": "Num 3:25", "book": "NUM", "chapter": 3, "verse": 25}, {"raw": "1Chr 5:14", "book": "1CH", "chapter": 5, "verse": 14}, {"raw": "Esth 2:15", "book": "EST", "chapter": 2, "verse": 15}, {"raw": "Esth 9:29", "book": "EST", "chapter": 9, "verse": 29}], "flagged": {"hebrew": ["אֲבִיחַ֫יִל", "אבחיל", "אֲבִיהַיִל", "אֲבִיהָ֑יִל"], "aramaic": [], "greek": [], "translit": [], "abbreviations": ["Hal"]}, "covers": [], "bdbid": "BDB27", "source": "BDB", "testament": "OT"}